[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an XML External Entity (XXE) vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the code processes XML data using `JSDOM` without any indication of disabling external entity resolution or properly securing the XML parsing process. If the XML data is user-supplied or can be manipulated, an attacker could inject malicious XML containing external entity references, potentially leading to unauthorized access to sensitive files, server-side request forgery (SSRF), or other unintended behaviors. The lack of safeguards against external entity processing is the root cause of this vulnerability.

